<section image-layout="blank" id="eegalualJs" background-color="heading"><grid spacing="none"><grid-item id="QPZ7Pvyh9N" vertical-align="center" colspan="35"><p role="eyebrow">Visual communication · Media evolution</p><h1 font-size="46pt">The page changed its behavior</h1><p font-size="lg">It did not disappear. It moved from fixed arrangement, to interactive surface, to variable output.</p><spacer mode="fixed" size="18pt"></spacer><grid divider="sm palette-5" vertical-sizing="hug"><grid-item colspan="20"><h4>01 · Fixed</h4></grid-item><grid-item colspan="20"><h4>02 · Linked</h4></grid-item><grid-item colspan="20"><h4>03 · Variable</h4></grid-item></grid><spacer mode="fixed" size="18pt"></spacer><hr color="accent" thickness="md" width="xs"><p font-size="18pt"><b>Thesis:</b> media evolution reorganizes production, distribution, interaction, and authorship. It does not guarantee improvement.</p></grid-item><grid-item id="sdVUHjGz-L" padding="0" colspan="25"><grid direction="vertical" spacing="none"><grid-item id="756UDBpbrf" padding="0" rowspan="50"><img src="https://cdn-staging.gamma.app/QWjS6fBfpt/generated-images/u0NlYkazBUh_CQgo9NLgg.png" saved-media-id="gq70rd11z5uaxu9" source="image.ai-generated" background="true" image-style="editorial-media-study" alt="Large-format editorial studio photograph of one page-like media mechanism evolving across three aligned stages: a rigid archive-buff paper frame, a linked screen-grey window, and several variable sheets emerging along vermilion plotter paths, arranged as a precise material study under cool raking daylight on warm paper, carbon black structural elements, generous negative space, no text or lettering" meta="{&quot;width&quot;:1248,&quot;height&quot;:1664}"></grid-item><grid-item id="2GtyIQ1AfO" background-color="accent" padding="10pt 14pt" rowspan="10"><p role="caption">Conceptual media study · not archival evidence</p></grid-item></grid></grid-item></grid></section>